>> title: Honey Mustard Dressing
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: mustard, honey, salad, dip, no-cook
>> counters: Diner, Deli, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: honey mustard, honey dijon
>> servings: 8
>> time: 10 min
>> step.1: whisk together
>> step.2: whisk in
>> step.3: stream in, whisk to emulsify
>> step.4: season

Whisk @dijon mustard{3%Tbs}(45 mL), @whole-grain mustard{1%Tbs}, and @honey{3%Tbs}(60 g) together.

Whisk @cider vinegar{2%Tbs}(30 mL) and @mayonnaise{2%Tbs} into @&(~1)mustard{}.

Stream @extra-virgin olive oil{1/3%cup}(80 mL) into @&(~1)base{} in a thin thread until glossy.

Season @&(~1)dressing{} with @kosher salt{1/4%tsp} and @black pepper{1/4%tsp}.
